.TH "PKGBUILD-anrix" "5" "2026-11-18"
.PP
.SH NAME
.PP
PKGBUILD-anrix - package build metadata supported by pi
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
A PKGBUILD is executed in the namespace sandbox.\& Standard metadata includes
\fBpkgname\fR, \fBpkgver\fR, \fBpkgrel\fR, \fBpkgdesc\fR, \fBurl\fR, \fBlicense\fR, \fBarch\fR, \fBsource\fR,
\fBsha256sums\fR, \fBdepends\fR, and \fBmakedepends\fR.\&
.PP
.SH DEPENDENCIES
.PP
Dependencies may use conditional syntax such as \fBwayland?\&wayland-protocols\fR
or \fB!\&systemd?\&eudev\fR.\& Version constraints use \fBpkg>=1.\&2\fR and \fBpkg=2.\&0\fR.\&
.PP
.SH FUNCTIONS
.PP
\fBprepare()\fR, \fBbuild()\fR, and \fBpackage()\fR populate the staged package directory.\&
Split packages use \fBpackage_<subpkg>()\fR.\& An optional \fB.\&install\fR file may
define \fBpre_install()\fR, \fBpost_install()\fR, \fBpre_upgrade()\fR, \fBpost_upgrade()\fR,
\fBpre_remove()\fR, and \fBpost_remove()\fR.\&
